<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - BRE Properties upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BRE Properties upped.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley analyst Greg Whyte said he raised the rating on BRE Properties Inc to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Whyte said he sees the company's fundamental strength continuing and a &quot;fair amount of consolidation in some of their markets.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The real estate investment trust has 55 multi-family apartments in the western United States, with about 50 percent of assets and 60 percent of net operating income in California.</p>
<p>Shares rose 1/2 to 24-3/4.</p>
</text>
